<title>USA: Industrial Scientific buyback authorized.</title>
<headline>Industrial Scientific buyback authorized.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Scientific Corp said on Thursday that its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 10 percent, or 337,500, of its issued and outstanding shares.</p>
<p>Purchases would be made in the open market, or in privately negotiated transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>Industrial Scientific designs, makes and sells gas monitoring instruments and other technical products.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
